WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.050 --> 00:00:01.937
Three options sit on one line.

2
00:00:01.937 --> 00:00:06.438
Refresh keeps fifteen hundred
servers, about fifty million dollars,

3
00:00:06.438 --> 00:00:11.255
and another capital event every five
years, with every server to baseline,

4
00:00:11.255 --> 00:00:14.413
scan, patch and carry in
the system security plan.

5
00:00:14.413 --> 00:00:18.994
Consolidate puts twenty-four distribution
points in twelve hubs for about ten

6
00:00:18.994 --> 00:00:21.216
million dollars in first-year capital,

7
00:00:21.216 --> 00:00:24.549
which also funds the transport
that cloud workloads need.

8
00:00:24.549 --> 00:00:29.850
Retire is the end state: no distribution
points at all, once five gates close.

9
00:00:29.850 --> 00:00:32.059
Consolidation is the interim step,

10
00:00:32.059 --> 00:00:36.460
so it fits an estate whose management
platform is already shrinking.
